* ''The full new design, no lift'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"Unpono, rip out old code, enact the full new design, early-alpha law holds."//). No per-face working document stands for any wiki but the daemon's: every other wiki's working layer rests in a realm workbench at `realmWorkbenchDocUrl(realm, slug)`; the daemon wiki stays face-private; workspaces bind at `/lar/workspaces/<name>`; the recipe reads canon -> workbench -> personal -> draft -> temp. Recovery rides the disk mirrors seeding back, never a migration. Landed (`6576c2313`, `594a22378`); `F3` rests in #/ashes.

